sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TTS as tts/run_tts.py
  participant Router as voice/router.py
  participant Policy as voice/base.py language policy
  participant XTTS as XTTSEngine
  participant Sarvam as SarvamEngine
  participant F5 as IndicF5Engine disabled
  participant Validate as audio_validation

  TTS->>Router: select_voice_engine(request)
  Router->>Policy: normalize target language
  alt Sarvam-supported Indian language and indic backend is sarvam
    Router->>Sarvam: require SARVAM_API_KEY and synthesize managed TTS
    Sarvam-->>Router: WAV + managed_tts metadata
  else XTTS-supported global language
    Router->>Router: require reference_audio when cloning_required
    Router->>XTTS: synthesize with speaker_wav and language
    XTTS-->>Router: WAV + speaker-reference metadata
  else IndicF5 explicitly preferred and enabled
    Router->>F5: require local_enabled, reference audio, exact reference text
    F5-->>Router: WAV only if approved local execution works
  else unsupported or disabled route
    Router-->>TTS: fail loudly; no generic fallback
  end
  Router->>Validate: validate_generated_audio(output.wav)
  Validate-->>TTS: pass or raise clear error

